an\u00e9es et pr\u00e9par\u00e9es) et discussions. Exercices en classe et au laboratoire. Posting limited to: Professeur \u00e0 temps-partiel r\u00e9gulier / Regular Part-Time Professor Date Posted (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/10/01 Applications must be received BEFORE (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/11/01 Expected Enrolment: 30 Approval date: 2026/10/01 Number of credits: 3 Work Hours: 39 Hourly Rate: Cours de langue / Language Course: $203.54 (2024-2025) The academic year starts on September 1 and ends on August 31. These rates do not included vacation pay nor statutory pay. These rates will be applied until a new collective agreement is ratified. Retro will be paid after the ratification. Course type: D Posting type: R\u00e9gulier / Regular Language of instruction: Fran\u00e7ais | French Competence in second language: N/A Course Schedule: Lundi | Monday 8:30-10:00 Jeudi | Thursday 10:00-11:30 - Cours hybride. Requirements: Maitrise en didactique du fran\u00e7ais langue seconde ou dans un domaine pertinent \u00e0 l\u2019enseignement du fran\u00e7ais langue seconde.\u00a0 Deux ans d\u2019exp\u00e9rience de l\u2019enseignement du FLS au niveau universitaire, ou \u00e9quivalent. Familiarit\u00e9 avec des logiciels et la technologie pertinente pour l\u2019enseignement des cours de fran\u00e7ais langue seconde.\u00a0 Tout professeur ayant enseign\u00e9 un cours FLS/ESL \u00e0 l'ILOB\u00a0avant le 1er janvier 2018 est consid\u00e9r\u00e9 comme r\u00e9pondant \u00e0 l'exigence de dipl\u00f4me. Additional Information and/or Comments: An acceptable level of education and/or experience could be viewed as being equivalent to the educational required and/or demonstrated experience. If you are invited to continue the selection process, please notify us of any adaptive measures you might require. Information you send us will be handled respectfully and in complete confidence. Employees are required under provincial law to successfully complete all mandatory legislated training. The list of training m